r 3D features)</p>\n    </div>\n    <!-- New Ticket Price Info. Added 21-07-2017 -->\n    <!-- dont load if on browser udpate page -->\n        <!-- Ad: Leaderboard -->\n    <div id=\"header-a-d\" class=\"leaderboard\">\n        <div class=\"a-d-wrapper\" style=\"max-height: 250px\">\n<div id='div-gpt-ad-1734906484118-0' style='min-width: 300px; min-height: 50px;'>\n  \n</div>\n\n</div>    </div>\n    <!-- end of Ad: Leaderboard -->\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <div class=\"nav-wrapper\">\n    <button class=\"close-btn\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12\" /></svg></button>\n    <nav role=\"main-navigation\">\n        <ul>\n            <li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london\">Home</a></li>\n            <li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/films/out-now\">Films Out Now</a></li>\n            <li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/films/coming-soon\">Films Coming Soon</a></li>\n            <li class=\"mobile-show \"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/films/watch-with-baby\">Watch With Baby</a></li>\n            <li class=\"mobile-show \"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/films/hard-of-hearing\">Subtitled for the Hard of Hearing</a></li>\n            <li class=\"mobile-show \"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/films/autism-friendly\">Autism Friendly Films</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/about-us\">About Us</a></li>\n            <li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/cinema/information\">Cinema Info</a></li>\n            <li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/scholarships\">Scholarships</a></li>\n            <li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/news-and-events\">News &amp; Events</a></li>\n        </ul>\n    </nav>\n</div>\n    <!-- end of