            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en-GB\">\n<head>\n     <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\">\n<meta name=\"HandheldFriendly\" content=\"True\" />\n<meta name=\"MobileOptimized\" content=\"320\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, minimum-scale=1 maximum-scale=1.0\" />\n<meta name=\"format-detection\" content=\"telephone=no\">\n<meta name=\"_token\" content=\"wP6XyqtIHyHgjq6QELwQU3JX8FhCeWg3FuDCOBXj\" />\n<title>Frankenstein - Peckhamplex Multi-Screen Cinema</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Multi-screen cinema showing the latest blockbuster and 3D film releases, with cheap tickets all day\">\n<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"peckhamplex, peckham plex, peckham, cinema, cinemas, films, film, trailers, trailer, london, cinemas london, peckham cinemas , Frankenstein\">\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Premier\" />\n<meta name=\"distribution\" content=\"GLOBAL\" />\n<meta name=\"revisit-after\" content=\"1 days\" />\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"ALL, Index, Follow\" />\n<meta name=\"language\" content=\"en-GB\" />\n<meta name=\"rating\" content=\"Safe for Kids\" />\n<meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"Peckhamplex 2025\" />\n<meta name=\"classification\" content=\"Entertainment\" />\n<meta http-equiv=\"Pragma\" content=\"no-cache\" />\n<meta name=\"google-site-verification\" content=\"g8ZPEvRuEunj0EkCxBXtImulPtTbbUBmvFQ7FCxG8-k\" />\n<meta name=\"msvalidate.01\" content=\"DF6282279EE47CDAC23DAFC60BAA0902\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/film/frankenstein\">\n<link rel=\"mask-icon\" href=\"/imgs/icons/pecky-masked-icon.svg\" color=\"#f918ac\">\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-precomposed\" sizes=\"57x57\" href=\"/imgs/icons/apple-touch-icon-57x57.png\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-precomposed\" sizes=\"114x114\" href=\"/imgs/icons/apple-touch-icon-114x114.png\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-precomposed\" si