ng the consequences of his past.</p>\n                                                                    </div><!-- end of synopsis -->\n                                        <a name=\"watchwithbaby\" id=\"watchwithbaby\"></a>\n\n                    \n                    <!-- Book Tickets -->\n                                        <div class=\"book-tickets\">\n        <h3>Book Tickets</h3>\n    <div class=\"book-tickets-listings\">\n\n                                        <div class=\"date-wrapper\">\n            <p class=\"ticket-date\">Monday 27th October 2025</p>\n            <div class=\"btn-group\" role=\"group\">\n                                                <a class=\"btn btn-info\" onclick=\"gtag('event', 'click', {'event_category' :'book tickets', 'event_label': 'One Battle After Another : Monday 27th October 2025 at 20:00'})\" href=\"https://ticketing.eu.veezi.com/purchase/75784?siteToken=zkD3Bh7H%2fkuZI9VTgCj%2bgg%3d%3d\" target=\"_blank\"><time datetime=\"2025-10-27T20:00\">20:00</time></a>\n                                            </div>\n        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"date-wrapper\">\n            <p class=\"ticket-date\">Tuesday 28th October 2025</p>\n            <div class=\"btn-group\" role=\"group\">\n                                                <a class=\"btn btn-info\" onclick=\"gtag('event', 'click', {'event_category' :'book tickets', 'event_label': 'One Battle After Another : Tuesday 28th October 2025 at 20:00'})\" href=\"https://ticketing.eu.veezi.com/purchase/75808?siteToken=zkD3Bh7H%2fkuZI9VTgCj%2bgg%3d%3d\" target=\"_blank\"><time datetime=\"2025-10-28T20:00\">20:00</time></a>\n                                            </div>\n        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"date-wrapper\">\n            <p class=\"ticket-date\">Wednesday 29th October 2025</p>\n            <div class=\"btn-group\" role=\"group\">\n                                                <a cla