            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en-GB\">\n<head>\n     <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\">\n<meta name=\"HandheldFriendly\" content=\"True\" />\n<meta name=\"MobileOptimized\" content=\"320\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, minimum-scale=1 maximum-scale=1.0\" />\n<meta name=\"format-detection\" content=\"telephone=no\">\n<meta name=\"_token\" content=\"bJlEyEL2oupwMYWLhtWyrQtHuAdTeVl77X1YNPff\" />\n<title>National Theatre Live: The Fifth Step</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Multi-screen cinema showing the latest blockbuster and 3D film releases, with cheap tickets all day\">\n<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"peckhamplex, peckham plex, peckham, cinema, cinemas, films, film, trailers, trailer, london, cinemas london, peckham cinemas , National Theatre Live: The Fifth Step\">\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Premier\" />\n<meta name=\"distribution\" content=\"GLOBAL\" />\n<meta name=\"revisit-after\" content=\"1 days\" />\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"ALL, Index, Follow\" />\n<meta name=\"language\" content=\"en-GB\" />\n<meta name=\"rating\" content=\"Safe for Kids\" />\n<meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"Peckhamplex 2025\" />\n<meta name=\"classification\" content=\"Entertainment\" />\n<meta http-equiv=\"Pragma\" content=\"no-cache\" />\n<meta name=\"google-site-verification\" content=\"g8ZPEvRuEunj0EkCxBXtImulPtTbbUBmvFQ7FCxG8-k\" />\n<meta name=\"msvalidate.01\" content=\"DF6282279EE47CDAC23DAFC60BAA0902\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/film/national-theatre-live-the-fifth-step\">\n<link rel=\"mask-icon\" href=\"/imgs/icons/pecky-masked-icon.svg\" color=\"#f918ac\">\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-precomposed\" sizes=\"57x57\" href=\"/imgs/icons/apple-touch-icon-57x57.png\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-precomposed\" sizes=\"114x114\" href=\"/imgs/icons/apple-touch-icon-114x114.png\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-precomposed\" sizes=\"72x72\" href=\"/imgs/icons/apple-touch-icon-72x72.png\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-precomposed\" sizes=\"144x144\" href=\"/imgs/icons/apple-touch-icon-144x144.png\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-precomposed\" sizes=\"60x60\" href=\"/imgs/icons/apple-touch-icon-60x60.png\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-precomposed\" sizes=\"120x120\" href=\"/imgs/icons/apple-touch-icon-120x120.png\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-precomposed\" sizes=\"76x76\" href=\"/imgs/icons/apple-touch-icon-76x76.png\" />\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-precomposed\" sizes=\"152x152\" href=\"/imgs/icons/apple-touch-icon-152x152.png\" />\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/imgs/icons/favicon-196x196.png\" sizes=\"196x196\" />\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/imgs/icons/favicon-96x96.png\" sizes=\"96x96\" />\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/imgs/icons/favicon-32x32.png\" sizes=\"32x32\" />\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/imgs/icons/favicon-16x16.png\" sizes=\"16x16\" />\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/imgs/icons/favicon-128.png\" sizes=\"128x128\" />\n<meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"Peckhamplex\" />\n<meta name=\"msapplication-TileColor\" content=\"#f918ac\" />\n<meta name=\"msapplication-TileImage\" content=\"/imgs/icons/mstile-144x144.png\" />\n<meta name=\"msapplication-square70x70logo\" content=\"/imgs/icons/mstile-70x70.png\" />\n<meta name=\"msapplication-square150x150logo\" content=\"/imgs/icons/mstile-150x150.png\" />\n<meta name=\"msapplication-wide310x150logo\" content=\"/imgs/icons/mstile-310x150.png\" />\n<meta name=\"msapplication-square310x310logo\" content=\"/imgs/icons/mstile-310x310.png\" />\n<meta property=\"fb:admins\" content=\"162039430516395\" />\n<meta property=\"fb:app_id\" content=\"1524763987822481\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/imgs/posters/trailers/national-theatre-live-the-fifth-step.jpg\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"National Theatre Live: The Fifth Step\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/film/national-theatre-live-the-fifth-step\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Peckhamplex Multi-screen Cinema London\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"company\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Multi-screen cinema showing the latest blockbuster and 3D film releases, with cheap tickets all day\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/film/national-theatre-live-the-fifth-step\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"National Theatre Live: The Fifth Step\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Multi-screen cinema showing the latest blockbuster and 3D film releases, with cheap tickets all day\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/imgs/posters/trailers/national-theatre-live-the-fifth-step.jpg\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@peckhamplex\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:creator\" content=\"@peckhamplex\">\n<meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"National Theatre Live: The Fifth Step\">\n<meta itemprop=\"description\" content=\"Multi-screen cinema showing the latest blockbuster and 3D film releases, with cheap tickets all day\">\n<meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/imgs/posters/trailers/national-theatre-live-the-fifth-step.jpg\">\n\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager -->\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/js/libs.min.js\"></script>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/css/s/main.min.css\" />     <!-- Load Facebook SDK for JavaScript -->\n<div id=\"fb-root\"></div>\n<script>\n    window.fbAsyncInit = function() {\n        FB.init({\n          appId      : '1524763987822481',\n          xfbml      : true,\n          version    : 'v2.5'\n        });\n      };\n\n      (function(d, s, id) {\n      var js, fjs = d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];\n      if (d.getElementById(id)) return;\n      js = d.createElement(s); js.id = id;\n      js.src = \"//connect.facebook.net/en_GB/sdk.js\";\n      fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js, fjs);\n    }(document, 'script', 'facebook-jssdk'));\n  </script>\n<!-- Google Share -->\n<script src=\"https://apis.google.com/js/platform.js\" async defer></script>\n<!-- Twitter-->\n<script>!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],p=/^http:/.test(d.location)?'http':'https';if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=p+'://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document, 'script', 'twitter-wjs');</script>\n\t <style>\n\t\t.yoti-wrapper {\n\t\t\t display: flex;\n\t\t\t justify-content: flex-start;\n\t\t\t align-items: flex-start;\n\t\t\t width: 100%;\n\t\t\t \n\t\t }\n\t\t.yoti-wrapper .image {\n\t\t\tmargin: 0 auto;\n\t\t\t padding-right: 2rem;\n\t\t\t width: 25%;\n\t\t}\n\t\t.yoti-wrapper .image img {\n\t\t\t max-width: 100%;\n\t\t\t border: 1px #ccc solid;\n\t\t}\n\t\t.yoti-wrapper .content {\n\t\t\tflex: 1 1 auto;\n\t\t}\n\n\t\t@media screen and (max-width:680px) {\n\t\t\t.yoti-wrapper {\n\t\t\t\tdisplay: block;\n\t\t\t\ttext-align: center\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t.yoti-wrapper .image, .yoti-wrapper .image img, .yoti-wrapper .content {\n\t\t\t\ttext-align: center;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t.yoti-wrapper .image {\n\t\t\t\tpadding-right: 0;\n\t\t\t\tpadding-bottom: 2rem;\n\t\t\t\twidth: auto;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t.yoti-wrapper .image img {margin: 0 auto;width: 300px;}\n\t\t\t\n\t\t}\n\t </style>\n\t \n</head>\n<body>\n<!-- Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n    <div class=\"conatiner\">\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header >\n    <div class=\"mobile-menu\">\n        <div class=\"title-bar\">\n            <h1>Peckhamplex</h1>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"menu-btn\"><button><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M3.75 6.75h16.5M3.75 12h16.5m-16.5 5.25h16.5\" /></svg></button></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"title-treatment\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london\"><img src=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/imgs/generic/peckhamplex-title-treatment.png\" alt=\"Peckhamplex London logo\" title=\"Peckhamplex, London\" /></a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.timeout.com/london/news/our-favourite-venues-in-london-right-now-time-outs-2024-recommended-stickers-have-hit-the-streets-121724\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/imgs/generic/timeout-award-2024.jpg\" alt=\"Time Out The Best of The City 2024 Award\" title=\"We are very proud to receive the Time Out Award for The Best of The City 2024\" class=\"header-award\" /></a>\n        <!--<a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london\"><img src=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/imgs/generic/peckhamplex-title-treatment.png\" alt=\"Peckhamplex London logo\" title=\"Peckhamplex, London\" /></a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.timeout.com/london/cinemas/peckhamplex\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/imgs/generic/uk-london-badge-black-2018.png\" alt=\"Time Out Love London Award 2018 badge\" alt=\"Peckhamplex is proud to receive a Time Out Love London Award 2018\" class=\"header-award\" /></a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.timeout.com/london/news/our-favourite-venues-in-london-right-now-time-outs-2024-recommended-stickers-have-hit-the-streets-121724\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/imgs/generic/timeout-2024.png\" alt=\"Time Out London Award 2024 badge\" alt=\"Peckhamplex is proud to receive a Time Out The Best of The City 2024 Award\" class=\"header-award\" /></a>-->\n    </div>\n    <!-- New Ticket Price Info. Added 21-07-2017 -->\n    <div class=\"ticket-info-wrapper\">\n        <p style=\"font-size: 20px;\">ALL TICKETS <span style=\"color: #bf4495;\">&pound;6.99*</span> EVERY DAY <span style=\"font-size:14px\">(*60p booking fee)</span></p>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(Additional &pound;1 supplement for 3D features)</p>\n    </div>\n    <!-- New Ticket Price Info. Added 21-07-2017 -->\n    <!-- dont load if on browser udpate page -->\n        <!-- Ad: Leaderboard -->\n    <div id=\"header-a-d\" class=\"leaderboard\">\n        <div class=\"a-d-wrapper\" style=\"max-height: 250px\">\n<div id='div-gpt-ad-1734906484118-0' style='min-width: 300px; min-height: 50px;'>\n  \n</div>\n\n</div>    </div>\n    <!-- end of Ad: Leaderboard -->\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <div class=\"nav-wrapper\">\n    <button class=\"close-btn\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12\" /></svg></button>\n    <nav role=\"main-navigation\">\n        <ul>\n            <li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london\">Home</a></li>\n            <li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/films/out-now\">Films Out Now</a></li>\n            <li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/films/coming-soon\">Films Coming Soon</a></li>\n            <li class=\"mobile-show \"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/films/watch-with-baby\">Watch With Baby</a></li>\n            <li class=\"mobile-show \"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/films/hard-of-hearing\">Subtitled for the Hard of Hearing</a></li>\n            <li class=\"mobile-show \"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/films/autism-friendly\">Autism Friendly Films</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/about-us\">About Us</a></li>\n            <li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/cinema/information\">Cinema Info</a></li>\n            <li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/scholarships\">Scholarships</a></li>\n            <li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/news-and-events\">News &amp; Events</a></li>\n        </ul>\n    </nav>\n</div>\n    <!-- end of Navigation -->\n    \n</header>\n        \n        <!-- ads wrapper -->\n        <div class=\"outer-wrapper\">\n            <!-- left skyscroaer ad -->\n                <div  id=\"skyscraper\" class=\"skyscraper-left\">\n    <div class=\"a-d-wrapper\">\n<div id='div-gpt-ad-1680277312471-0' style='min-width: 120px; min-height: 600px;'>\n  \n</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n            <!-- content wrapper -->\n            <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <!-- Main Content -->\n                <main class=\"main-content\">\n                    <div class=\"inner-content\" id=\"film-details-page\">\n    <!-- Top Section -->\n    <!-- HP: Top -->\n<div class=\"top-block-wrapper clearfix\">\n    <!-- Carousel -->\n    <div class=\"carousel-block\">\n        <div class=\"choose-film-wrapper\">\n   <div class=\"choose-film-box\" id=\"choose-film-options\" data-site-token=\"zkD3Bh7H%2fkuZI9VTgCj%2bgg%3d%3d\">\n      <div class=\"film-by-title\">\n          <button id=\"choose-by-title\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-lg\"\n                  data-url=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/api/v1/film/by/title\"\n                  data-option=\"by-title\">Choose Film<span><br /></span> by Title</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"film-by-date\">\n          <button id=\"choose-by-date\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-lg\"\n                  data-url=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/api/v1/film/by/dates\"\n                  data-option=\"by-date\">Choose Film<span><br /></span> by Date</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"film-by-date\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-lg\" onclick=\"location.href='https://www.peckhamplex.london/films/listings'\">Weekly Film<span><br /></span> Listings</button>\n      </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n        <div class=\"carousel-player-wrapper\">\n            <!--Cookie Notice-->\n            <div class=\"cookie-inf\" style=\"position:absolute;z-index:9999;width:100%;height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:flex-end;user-select:none;\">\n                <div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;padding:30px;background-color:#bf4495;text-align:center\">\n                    Please accept targeting cookies to watch this video content.<br />\n                    <a href=\"javascript:CookieScript.instance.show()\">Click here to change your cookie preferences</a>.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <!--Cookie Notice-->\n                <!-- Carousel Player Wrapper -->\n<div class=\"carousel-player-wrapper\">\n    <!-- Royalslider Wrapper -->\n    <div id=\"site-carousel\" class=\"royalSlider rsMinW\">\n                    <!-- Image -->\n            <div class=\"rsContent\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ImageObject\">\n                <img class=\"rsImg\" src=\"/imgs/posters/trailers/national-theatre-live-the-fifth-step.jpg\" alt=\"National Theatre Live: The Fifth Step\">\n                <meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"National Theatre Live: The Fifth Step\">\n                <link itemprop=\"image\" href=\"/imgs/posters/trailers/national-theatre-live-the-fifth-step.jpg\" />\n                    <meta itemprop=\"description\" content=\"Olivier Award-winner Jack Lowden (Slow Horses, Dunkirk) is joined by Emmy and BAFTA-winner Martin Freeman (The Hobbit, The Responder) in the critically acclaimed and subversively funny new play by David Ireland.\r\n\r\nAfter years in the 12-step programme of Alcoholics Anonymous, James becomes a sponsor to newcomer Luka. The pair bond over black coffee, trade stories and build a fragile friendship out of their shared experiences. But as Luka approaches step five – the moment of confession – dangerous truths emerge, threatening the trust on which both of their recoveries depend.\r\n\r\nFinn den Hertog directs the provocative and entertaining production filmed live from @sohoplace on London’s West End.\">\n               \n            </div><!-- end of image -->\n        \n     </div>\n    <!-- End of Royalslider Wrapper -->\n</div>\n<!-- End of Carousel Player Wrapper -->\n<a name=\"booktickets\" id=\"booktickets\"></a>        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- end of Carousel -->\n    <!-- Side Details -->\n    <div class=\"side-details\">\n        <!-- company-details -->\n        <div class=\"company-details\">\n            <div class=\"cp-address\">\n    <small>Peckhamplex 95a Rye Lane, London, SE15 4ST</small><br />\n    <a class=\"phone\" href=\"tel:0844 567 2742\">0844 567 2742<sup>*</sup></a><br />\n    <a class=\"email\" href=\"mailTo:managers@peckhamplex.net\">managers@peckhamplex.net</a>\n</div>\n<!-- -->\n<div class=\"cp-statement\">\n\n    <p>Your friendly independent, licensed, multiplex cinema in South London and home to the £6.99 cinema ticket.</p>\n\n</div>\n<!-- -->\n<div class=\"social-strip-wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"social-outer-wrapper\">\n    <p>Follow Us on</p>\n    <div class=\"social-wrapper\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/PeckhamPlex\" class=\"facebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"m-0 p-0 text-gray-400 hover:text-accent focus:text-accent\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 21\"><title>Following us on Facebook</title><path d=\"M18,2H15a5,5,0,0,0-5,5v3H7v4h3v8h4V14h3l1-4H14V7a1,1,0,0,1,1-1h3Z\" transform=\"translate(-6.5 -1.5)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/PeckhamPlex\" class=\"twitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"m-0 p-0 text-gray-400 hover:text-accent focus:text-accent\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 25.521 21.207\"><title>Following us on Twitter</title><path d=\"M25.521,3a12.149,12.149,0,0,1-3.5,1.705A4.993,4.993,0,0,0,13.26,8.05V9.165A11.881,11.881,0,0,1,3.229,4.116S-1.229,14.147,8.8,18.605A12.974,12.974,0,0,1,1,20.835c10.031,5.573,22.292,0,22.292-12.818a5.016,5.016,0,0,0-.089-.925A8.6,8.6,0,0,0,25.521,3Z\" transform=\"translate(-0.5 -2.412)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n        \n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/peckhamplexcinema/\" class=\"instagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"m-0 p-0 text-gray-400 hover:text-accent focus:text-accent\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 21 21\"><title>Following us on Instagram</title><g transform=\"translate(-1.5 -1.5)\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\" transform=\"translate(2 2)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16,11.37A4,4,0,1,1,12.63,8,4,4,0,0,1,16,11.37Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x2=\"0.01\" transform=\"translate(17.5 6.5)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g></svg>\n        </a>\n    </div>\n</div></div>        </div>\n        <!-- end of company-details-->\n        <!-- Ad: MPU -->\n        <div id=\"mpu-a-d\" class=\"mpu\">\n            <div class=\"a-d-wrapper\">\n<div id='div-gpt-ad-1734906484118-0' style='min-width: 300px; min-height: 50px;'>\n  \n</div>\n</div>\n        </div>\n            <!-- end of Ad: MPU -->\n    </div>\n    <!-- end of Side Details -->\n</div>\n<!-- end of HP: Top -->\n    <!-- end of Top Section -->\n    <div class=\"film-details-wrapper\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Movie\">\n        <link itemprop=\"url\" href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/film/national-theatre-live-the-fifth-step\" />\n\n        <h1 class=\"page-title\" itemprop=\"name\">National Theatre Live: The Fifth Step</h1>\n        <!-- Film Details -->\n        <div class=\"inner-content-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"details-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"info-section\">\n                    <div class=\"poster-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"poster\">\n                                                        <img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"/imgs/posters/large/national-theatre-live-the-fifth-step.jpg\" alt=\"National Theatre Live: The Fifth Step\" title=\"National Theatre Live: The Fifth Step\" />\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"info\">\n                        <p><b>Format:</b> 2D Digital\n                                                    </p>\n                        <p><b>Genre:</b> Opera</p>\n                        <p><b>Running Time:</b> 1 hour 27 minutes</p>\n                        <p><b>Rate:</b> 15<br /></p>\n                        <br />\n                        <p><i class=\"fa fa-info-circle\"></i> Free List Suspended</p>                        <p><i class=\"fa fa-wheelchair\"></i> Wheelchair/Disabled Access</p>                                                <p class=\"more-info\">For more cinema access information <br class=\"show-on-ip\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/cinema/access\">click here</a>.\n                        <meta itemprop=\"dateCreated\" content=\"01-01-1970\">\n                    </div>\n\n                </div><!-- end of poster -->\n                <div class=\"content\">\n                    <!-- synopsis -->\n                                        <div class=\"synopsis\">\n                        <h3>National Theatre Live: The Fifth Step Synopsis</h3>\n                        <p itemprop=\"description\">Olivier Award-winner Jack Lowden (Slow Horses, Dunkirk) is joined by Emmy and BAFTA-winner Martin Freeman (The Hobbit, The Responder) in the critically acclaimed and subversively funny new play by David Ireland.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter years in the 12-step programme of Alcoholics Anonymous, James becomes a sponsor to newcomer Luka. The pair bond over black coffee, trade stories and build a fragile friendship out of their shared experiences. But as Luka approaches step five – the moment of confession – dangerous truths emerge, threatening the trust on which both of their recoveries depend.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFinn den Hertog directs the provocative and entertaining production filmed live from @sohoplace on London’s West End.</p>\n                                                                    </div><!-- end of synopsis -->\n                                        <a name=\"watchwithbaby\" id=\"watchwithbaby\"></a>\n\n                    \n                    <!-- Book Tickets -->\n                                        <div class=\"book-tickets\">\n        <h3>Book Tickets</h3>\n    <div class=\"book-tickets-listings\">\n\n                        <div class=\"date-wrapper\">\n            <p class=\"ticket-date\">Thursday 27th November 2025</p>\n            <div class=\"btn-group\" role=\"group\">\n                                                <a class=\"btn btn-info\" onclick=\"gtag('event', 'click', {'event_category' :'book tickets', 'event_label': 'National Theatre Live: The Fifth Step : Thursday 27th November 2025 at 19:30'})\" href=\"https://ticketing.eu.veezi.com/purchase/73254?siteToken=zkD3Bh7H%2fkuZI9VTgCj%2bgg%3d%3d\" target=\"_blank\"><time datetime=\"2025-11-27T19:30\">19:30</time></a>\n                                            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        \n        \n    </div>\n    <br />\n</div><!-- end of book-tickets -->                                                            <!-- Book Tickets -->\n\n                    <!-- Cast Crew -->\n                                        <div class=\"cast-crew\">\n\t<h3>Cast &amp; Crew</h3>\n\t<!-- Directors -->\n\t\t<div class=\"cast-crew-wrapper\">\n\t\t<div cla