75 12h16.5m-16.5 5.25h16.5\" /></svg></button></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"title-treatment\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london\"><img src=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/imgs/generic/peckhamplex-title-treatment.png\" alt=\"Peckhamplex London logo\" title=\"Peckhamplex, London\" /></a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.timeout.com/london/news/our-favourite-venues-in-london-right-now-time-outs-2024-recommended-stickers-have-hit-the-streets-121724\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/imgs/generic/timeout-award-2024.jpg\" alt=\"Time Out The Best of The City 2024 Award\" title=\"We are very proud to receive the Time Out Award for The Best of The City 2024\" class=\"header-award\" /></a>\n        <!--<a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london\"><img src=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/imgs/generic/peckhamplex-title-treatment.png\" alt=\"Peckhamplex London logo\" title=\"Peckhamplex, London\" /></a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.timeout.com/london/cinemas/peckhamplex\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/imgs/generic/uk-london-badge-black-2018.png\" alt=\"Time Out Love London Award 2018 badge\" alt=\"Peckhamplex is proud to receive a Time Out Love London Award 2018\" class=\"header-award\" /></a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.timeout.com/london/news/our-favourite-venues-in-london-right-now-time-outs-2024-recommended-stickers-have-hit-the-streets-121724\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/imgs/generic/timeout-2024.png\" alt=\"Time Out London Award 2024 badge\" alt=\"Peckhamplex is proud to receive a Time Out The Best of The City 2024 Award\" class=\"header-award\" /></a>-->\n    </div>\n    <!-- New Ticket Price Info. Added 21-07-2017 -->\n    <div class=\"ticket-info-wrapper\">\n        <p style=\"font-size: 20px;\">ALL TICKETS <span style=\"color: #bf4495;\">&pound;6.99*</span> EVERY DAY <span style=\"font-size:14px\">(*60p booking fee)</span></p>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(Additional &pound;1 supplement for 3D features)</p>\n    </div>\n    <!-- New Ticket Price Info. Added 21-07-2017 -->\n    <!-- dont load if on browser udpate page -->\n        <!-- Ad: Leaderboard -->\n    <div id=\"header-a-d\" class=\"leaderboard\">\n        <div class=\"a-d-wrapper\" style=\"max-height: 250px\">\n<div id='div-gpt-ad-1734906484118-0' style='min-width: 300px; min-height: 50px;'>\n  \n</div>\n\n</div>    </div>\n    <!-- end of Ad: Leaderboard -->\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <div class=\"nav-wrapper\">\n    <button class=\"close-btn\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12\" /></svg></button>\n    <nav role=\"main-navigation\">\n        <ul>\n            <li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london\">Home</a></li>\n            <li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/films/out-now\">Films Out Now</a></li>\n            <li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/films/coming-soon\">Films Coming Soon</a></li>\n            <li class=\"mobile-show \"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/films/watch-with-baby\">Watch With Baby</a></li>\n            <li class=\"mobile-show \"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/films/hard-of-hearing\">Subtitled for the Hard of Hearing</a></li>\n            <li class=\"mobile-show \"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/films/autism-friendly\">Autism Friendly Films</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/about-us\">About Us</a></li>\n            <li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/cinema/information\">Cinema Info</a></li>\n            <li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/scholarships\">Scholarships</a></li>\n            <li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/news-and-events\">News &amp; Events</a></li>\n        </ul>\n    </nav>\n</div>\n    <!-- end of Navigation -->\n    \n</header>\n        \n        <!-- ads wrapper -->\n        <div class=\"outer-wrapper\">\n            <!-- left skyscroaer ad -->\n                <div  id=\"skyscraper\" class=\"skyscraper-left\">\n    <div class=\"a-d-wrapper\">\n<div id='div-gpt-ad-1680277312471-0' style='min-width: 120px; min-height: 600px;'>\n  \n</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n            <!-- content wrapper -->\n            <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <!-- Main Content -->\n                <main class=\"main-content\">\n                    <div class=\"inner-content\" id=\"film-details-page\">\n    <!-- Top Section -->\n    <!-- HP: Top -->\n<div class=\"top-block-wrapper clearfix\">\n    <!-- Carousel -->\n    <div class=\"carousel-block\">\n        <div class=\"choose-film-wrapper\">\n   <div class=\"choose-film-box\" id=\"choose-film-options\" data-site-token=\"zkD3Bh7H%2fkuZI9VTgCj%2bgg%3d%3d\">\n      <div class=\"film-by-title\">\n          <button id=\"choose-by-title\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-lg\"\n                  data-url=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/api/v1/film/by/title\"\n                  data-option=\"by-title\">Choose Film<span><br /></span> by Title</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"film-by-date\">\n          <button id=\"choose-by-date\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-lg\"\n                  data-url=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/api/v1/film/by/dates\"\n                  data-option=\"by-date\">Choose Film<span><br /></span> by Date</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"film-by-date\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-lg\" onclick=\"location.href='https://www.peckhamplex.london/films/listings'\">Weekly Film<span><br /></span> Listings</button>\n      </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n        <div class=\"carousel-player-wrapper\">\n            <!--Cookie Notice-->\n            <div class=\"cookie-inf\" style=\"position:absolute;z-index:9999;width:100%;height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:flex-end;user-select:none;\">\n                <div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;padding:30px;background-color:#bf4495;text-align:center\">\n                    Please accept targeting cookies to watch this video content.<br />\n                    <a href=\"javascript:CookieScript.instance.show()\">Click here to change your cookie preferences</a>.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <!--Cookie Notice-->\n                <!-- Carousel Player Wrapper -->\n<div class=\"carousel-player-wrapper\">\n    <!-- Royalslider Wrapper -->\n    <div id=\"site-carousel\" class=\"royalSlider rsMinW\">\n                    <!-- Trailer -->\n            <div class=\"rsContent\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/VideoObject\">\n                    <img class=\"rsImg\" data-rsVideo=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qub8lZlVlho\"  src=\"/imgs/posters/trailers/regretting-you.jpg\" alt=\"Regretting You\">\n                    <meta itemprop=\"embedURL\" content=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qub8lZlVlho\" />\n                     <meta itemprop=\"uploadDate\" content=\"2025-10-27T09:34:09+00:00\">\n                    <meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"Regretting You\">\n                    <meta  itemprop=\"thumbnailURL\" content=\"/imgs/posters/trailers/regretting-you.jpg\" />\n                    <meta itemprop=\"caption\" content=\"Regretting You\">\n                    <meta itemprop=\"description\" content=\"Centers on the strained relationship between young mother Morgan Grant and her teenage daughter Clara, exacerbated by Morgan's husband Chris's tragic death, forcing them to navigate life's challenges together.\">\n                    \n                </div><!-- end o trailer -->\n        \n        \n     </div>\n    <!-- End of Royalslider Wrapper -->\n</div>\n<!-- End of Carousel Player Wrapper -->\n<a name=\"booktickets\" id=\"booktickets\"></a>        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- end of Carousel -->\n    <!-- Side Details -->\n    <div class=\"side-details\">\n        <!-- company-details -->\n        <div class=\"company-details\">\n            <div class=\"cp-address\">\n    <small>Peckhamplex 95a Rye Lane, London, SE15 4ST</small><br />\n    <a class=\"phone\" href=\"tel:0844 567 2742\">0844 567 2742<sup>*</sup></a><br />\n    <a class=\"email\" href=\"mailTo:managers@peckhamplex.net\">managers@peckhamplex.net</a>\n</div>\n<!-- -->\n<div class=\"cp-statement\">\n\n    <p>Your friendly independent, licensed, multiplex cinema in South London and home to the £6.99 cinema ticket.</p>\n\n</div>\n<!-- -->\n<div class=\"social-strip-wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"social-outer-wrapper\">\n    <p>Follow Us on</p>\n    <div class=\"social-wrapper\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/PeckhamPlex\" class=\"facebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"m-0 p-0 text-gray-400 hover:text-accent focus:text-accent\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 21\"><title>Following us on Facebook</title><path d=\"M18,2H15a5,5,0,0,0-5,5v3H7v4h3v8h4V14h3l1-4H14V7a1,1,0,0,1,1-1h3Z\" transform=\"translate(-6.5 -1.5)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/PeckhamPlex\" class=\"twitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"m-0 p-0 text-gray-400 hover:text-accent focus:text-accent\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 25.521 21.207\"><title>Following us on Twitter</title><path d=\"M25.521,3a12.149,12.149,0,0,1-3.5,1.705A4.993,4.993,0,0,0,13.26,8.05V9.165A11.881,11.881,0,0,1,3.229,4.116S-1.229,14.147,8.8,18.605A12.974,12.974,0,0,1,1,20.835c10.031,5.573,22.292,0,22.292-12.818a5.016,5.016,0,0,0-.089-.925A8.6,8.6,0,0,0,25.521,3Z\" transform=\"translate(-0.5 -2.412)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n        \n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/peckhamplexcinema/\" class=\"instagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"m-0 p-0 text-gray-400 hover:text-accent focus:text-accent\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 21 21\"><title>Following us on Instagram</title><g transform=\"translate(-1.5 -1.5)\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\" transform=\"translate(2 2)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16,11.37A4,4,0,1,1,12.63,8,4,4,0,0,1,16,11.37Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x2=\"0.01\" transform=\"translate(17.5 6.5)\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g></svg>\n        </a>\n    </div>\n</div></div>        </div>\n        <!-- end of company-details-->\n        <!-- Ad: MPU -->\n        <div id=\"mpu-a-d\" class=\"mpu\">\n            <div class=\"a-d-wrapper\">\n<div id='div-gpt-ad-1734906484118-0' style='min-width: 300px; min-height: 50px;'>\n  \n</div>\n</div>\n        </div>\n            <!-- end of Ad: MPU -->\n    </div>\n    <!-- end of Side Details -->\n</div>\n<!-- end of HP: Top -->\n    <!-- end of Top Section -->\n    <div class=\"film-details-wrapper\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Movie\">\n        <link itemprop=\"url\" href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/film/regretting-you\" />\n\n        <h1 class=\"page-title\" itemprop=\"name\">Regretting You</h1>\n        <!-- Film Details -->\n        <div class=\"inner-content-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"details-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"info-section\">\n                    <div class=\"poster-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"poster\">\n                                                        <img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"/imgs/posters/large/regretting-you.jpg\" alt=\"Regretting You\" title=\"Regretting You\" />\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"info\">\n                        <p><b>Format:</b> 2D Digital\n                                                    </p>\n                        <p><b>Genre:</b> Drama</p>\n                        <p><b>Running Time:</b> 1 hour 56 minutes</p>\n                        <p><b>Rate:</b> 12A<br />infrequent strong language, moderate sex, drug misuse</p>\n                        <br />\n                        <p><i class=\"fa fa-info-circle\"></i> Free List Suspended</p>                        <p><i class=\"fa fa-wheelchair\"></i> Wheelchair/Disabled Access</p>                                                <p class=\"more-info\">For more cinema access information <br class=\"show-on-ip\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/cinema/access\">click here</a>.\n                        <meta itemprop=\"dateCreated\" content=\"01-01-1970\">\n                    </div>\n\n                </div><!-- end of poster -->\n                <div class=\"content\">\n                    <!-- synopsis -->\n                                        <div class=\"synopsis\">\n                        <h3>Regretting You Synopsis</h3>\n                        <p itemprop=\"description\">Centers on the strained relationship between young mother Morgan Grant and her teenage daughter Clara, exacerbated by Morgan's husband Chris's tragic death, forcing them to navigate life's challenges together.</p>\n                                                                    </div><!-- end of synopsis -->\n                                        <a name=\"watchwithbaby\" id=\"watchwithbaby\"></a>\n\n                    \n                    <!-- Book Tickets -->\n                                        <p>There are currently no dates/times available for this film.</p>\n                                                            <!-- Book Tickets -->\n\n                 